      "url": "https://x.com/snowjacuzzi/status/2092342821709914408",
      "text": "@Scobleizer Harsh climate adoptations and weightlifting self correction, able to process surgery level precision textilework and stairs balancing\n\nBasically robots need to be able to do hardcore minimum wage jobs and extreme physical labors\n\nThe problem is many engineers are wired to think problem solving as equations and geometric puzzle chessboarding not reality based thinking \n\nRobotics people really need to at least participate in shipyard welding, assembly lines in frozen food industry, barista management in top ten fast paced drivethrough shops in the area, understand nursing home challenges, how Temu or Coupang delivery works in various metropolitan settings.\n\nOptimism is useful but not for the application on wide range of things",
      "original_text": "@Scobleizer Harsh climate adoptations and weightlifting self correction, able to process surgery level precision textilework and stairs balancing\n\nBasically robots need to be able to do hardcore minimum wage jobs and extreme physical labors\n\nThe problem is many engineers are wired to think problem solving as equations and geometric puzzle chessboarding not reality based thinking \n\nRobotics people really need to at least participate in shipyard welding, assembly lines in frozen food industry, barista management in top ten fast paced drivethrough shops in the area, understand nursing home challenges, how Temu or Coupang delivery works in various metropolitan settings.\n\nOptimism is useful but not for the application on wide range of things",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "@Scobleizer 恶劣气候适应能力和举重式自我纠正，能够处理达到手术级精度的纺织作业以及楼梯平衡\n\n基本上，机器人需要能够做高强度的最低工资工作和极端体力劳动\n\n问题在于，许多工程师的思维模式是把解决问题看作方程和几何谜题式的棋盘推演，而不是基于现实的思考\n\n机器人领域的人真的至少需要参与造船厂焊接、冷冻食品行业流水线、本地区前十名快节奏得来速店的咖啡师管理，了解养老院面临的挑战，以及 Temu 或 Coupang 配送在各种都市环境中是如何运作的。\n\n乐观是有用的，但不适用于范围广泛的各种应用",
